  {
    "id": 1003003030010,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー！　真乃と灯織とわたし、\r\nどこかで２日間お休みもらうことってできる！？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bgm": "012",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "時期にもよるけど──\r\nどうした、どこか行きたいところでもあるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030020,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "カピバラがお風呂に入ってるところを見ながら、\r\n温泉に入れる場所があるんだって……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "真乃、そういうの好きじゃないかなって思って！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "なんかね、近くに最近できたリゾートホテルもあるみたいで\r\n朝は森で散歩したり、夜はホテルで天体観測ができたり──",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "自然いっぱいの綺麗な景色は、灯織が好きそうでしょっ？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だから、カピバラを見て、そのホテルに泊まって──\r\nってしたら、ふたりとも喜んでくれそうだなって思ったの！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "今度のバラエティの賞品をね、旅行券にしてもらって\r\nみんなで行ったらいいんじゃないかって──",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あっ\r\nもちろん真乃と灯織の意見も聞いてからなんだけど！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──なるほどな、そういうことか。話はわかった\r\n調整ならできると思うけど──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ほんと！？　やったぁ！\r\nじゃあじゃあ、ふたりにも聞いてみて──",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でもめぐる──こういう時、いつもみんなで楽しめるものに\r\nしてないか？　めぐるが欲しいもの、でもいいんだぞ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えっ？　……あ、そっか！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030101,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……うーん……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030101"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……この間ネットで見た、みんなで寝られそうなくらいの\r\n大きい鳥型のクッションも可愛かったし……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "新しいデジカメがあったら、写真も綺麗に撮れるし、\r\nふたりの携帯にも送りやすいし……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "──……そうだ！　灯織、事務所に\r\nもっと調味料があったらって言ってた気が──",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……めぐる？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん？　なぁに？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それも……\r\nめぐるが欲しいものじゃないな……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あっ！\r\n──……えへへ、そうだね。そうなんだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "せっかくなら、ふたりもって思っちゃうのは……\r\nダメ……かな……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──いや",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐるがそうしたいんだったら、別にいいんだ\r\n……本当にふたりが好きなんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うんっ！　もちろん！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だって、わたし──ふたりがいてくれるから\r\n楽しくアイドルができるんだもん",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……それに、ふたりがいてくれるなら\r\nきっと、これからもっと──",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030200,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "──ふふふ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030210,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "やっぱり、賞品は旅行券がいいな！\r\nふたりがいいよって言ってくれたら！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わかった。確認して申請しておくよ\r\n──獲れるといいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030220,
