  },
  {
    "speaker": "司会者",
    "text": "当たったのは……──マッサージチェアー！\r\n残念ですね、あと２cmってところでしょうか……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "共演者",
    "text": "あああめぐるちゃん惜しい～～～～！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030250,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへ……外しちゃいました……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "共演者",
    "text": "この矢がいけないのよ～～！　マッサージチェアーなら、\r\n私の時に当たってくれたらよかったのに……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "司会者",
    "text": "狙っていたものとは違いましたが、見事、賞品獲得です！\r\n八宮さん、こちらどうされますか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_a",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030260,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あのっ、わたしの賞品、プレゼントしたりっていうのは\r\nできますか？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030270,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "やっぱり、欲しい人に使ってもらうのが一番だと思うので！\r\nよかったらわたしの分、もらってほしいなって！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "共演者",
    "text": "えぇっ……？！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030280,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えっと、もし獲れなかったら、の時ですけど！\r\n自分で獲れたら、ふたつもいらないと思うので……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "司会者",
    "text": "番組としては問題ありませんよ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030290,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "よかった！　じゃあ──",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "共演者",
    "text": "嘘でしょ……なんていい子なの……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "共演者",
    "text": "よーーーーし！　お姉さん頑張る！\r\n絶対に旅行券当ててみせる！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003030300,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えっ！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300303/1003003030300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "共演者",
    "text": "見ててねめぐるちゃん！\r\nいっきまーす！",
